{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/training/weighted-vest-vs-rucksack","version_id":"ab775725b47f4b9f9ef5bacc991ec90e412d48130bd2a8de435e5af8b3fec077","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Making the decision, pack cargo capacity and load distribution matter for Mammoth, but the cited studies do not test vest-versus-pack suitability and the item supplies no comparative field testing. Commercial incentives warrant caution because the publisher earns affiliate commissions, receives GORUCK review units, and publishes unusually high volumes; the recent corrections improve transparency without supplying the missing evidence.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/weight-loss/can-rucking-be-your-only-exercise","version_id":"2a7879b683f10ab9328299cfac2d2719b7bb49cf69c7d2c7ad301806975cbe97","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this is a general exercise-program article rather than evidence about gear competitors should carry; passing mentions of a Garmin watch and foam roller provide no substantive gear evaluation. Commercial incentives include affiliate commissions and GORUCK-supplied review units.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/weight-loss/long-term-rucking-for-weight-loss-a-periodization-approach","version_id":"400c4348ec3f4e97eee69ca0b99be092da245db5ab40550722591b29f4b36c1b","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, the central subject is an untested weight-loss training and nutrition schedule, not Mammoth gear suitability; mentions of Yes4All plates and a Garmin watch do not supply gear-performance evidence. Commercial incentives include affiliate commissions and GORUCK-supplied review units.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/weight-loss/rucking-calorie-calculator-guide","version_id":"cdb5d280224dc2d9ebac2dfb3d4d83116e742df6ced2b09fd15d435ed04814c0","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this evaluates energy-expenditure models for recreational exercise and weight loss rather than in-scope gear; its calorie calculator is not a ballistic calculator, and generic watch references do not establish product suitability. The publisher's affiliate commissions and GORUCK review-unit relationship are commercial incentives.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/weight-loss/rucking-for-women","version_id":"20f721d5647cef2e73060b9f7115ccfde4156b261a5ccc48086e1118abbd3427","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Uncertainty, the measured-torso and loaded-harness checks offer practical pack-selection guidance for Piece 03, supported in part by a described seven-woman military-pack study reporting hip-belt fit problems; this does not establish any particular pack's performance. Commercial incentives require disclosing affiliate commissions and GORUCK-supplied units, while Diversity of perspectives requires acknowledging the absence of Mammoth practitioner testing.","piece_ids":["03"]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/weight-loss/rucking-vs-running-weight-loss","version_id":"d52e754452a56d01c291a77f646c5fa288f8139274be1b12ce93aa065e729365","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this compares exercise choices and weight-loss estimates rather than evaluating gear for Mammoth; plate, footwear, and anti-chafe references supply no substantive product evidence. The corrections appropriately limit unsupported fitness claims, but the publisher's affiliate commissions and GORUCK-supplied units remain relevant commercial relationships.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/goruck-rucker-5-0-review","version_id":"c5cfe3103d9e32bc14114ab94b8dd4340a277b5c1adbf9321588abff3618466c","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Freshness and novelty, the new field review supplies citable observations of stability, lumbar comfort, sweating, and subsequent trap soreness with a 20 lb plate plus unweighed supplies on hilly trails, supporting Pieces 01, 02, and 03. Commercial incentives and Uncertainty require identifying the GORUCK-gifted pack and affiliate relationship, attributing the findings to this reviewer, and limiting conclusions because testing covered only a first week in dry weather without the optional belt or a Mammoth loadout.","piece_ids":["01","02","03"]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/goruck-rucker-5-0-vs-4-0-review","version_id":"12a832181a4108d5144de011043784b1e42137723e9a6f4edbea8c90a5614446","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Freshness and novelty and Making the decision, this repeats the accepted Rucker 5.0 review's field observations and documented feature changes without a new comparative test; the author explicitly has not carried the 4.0. Credibility and Commercial incentives require treating the older model's information as manufacturer specifications and disclosing the gifted 5.0 and affiliate relationship, rather than treating upgrade recommendations as demonstrated comparative performance.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/goruck-rucker-vs-gr1","version_id":"6a7bdc8341b414f9b53738017f3cd857f57d82067bb2658a7b431c509920499c","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Credibility, Unsupported claims, and Making the decision, the pack comparison is relevant but provides no described comparative testing for its heavy-load superiority and abrasion-resistance claims; specifications and warranty terms do not establish those outcomes. Freshness and novelty also limits its value beyond the accepted Rucker review, while Commercial incentives requires disclosing affiliate sales incentives and GORUCK-supplied review units.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://ruckauthority.com/gear/hyperwear-hyper-vest-pro","version_id":"2ad8f08010a637a51f5ffbb05fa5474d4eded3951062f29e98f8376cc5f9043c","decision":"defer","reason":"Under Credibility, Unsupported claims, and Making the decision, possible load-carriage durability concerns merit investigation, but the untested review supplies no identifiable owner accounts or testing conditions sufficient to substantiate its strong comfort, longevity, and comparative-value verdicts. Commercial incentives require noting affiliate commissions and the publisher's GORUCK review-unit relationship, particularly because it recommends GORUCK alternatives; manufacturer capacity specifications alone do not validate those recommendations.","piece_ids":[]}
